### 1. Webhook deliveries that failed their first try — newest first
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook-deliveries/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "status": "FAILED",
  "source": "POST_CALL",
  "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Send a FAILED delivery once more
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook-deliveries/1/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Developer live SSE stream of webhook deliveries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/webhook-deliveries/listen
Accept: text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Inbound LiveKit SIP Gateway dispatch webhook (Public)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhooks/livekit/sip
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callId": "lk-sip-call-001",
  "caller": "+998901234567",
  "called": "+998712000000",
  "sipTrunkId": "trunk-livekit-main"
}
